{#
    The player card (docs/features/navigation README §4.8, CARD-03; first built for the Players page,
    docs/features/players-page/README.md): who - the name is the profile link -, level and tier, the six public
    numbers, the 12-month strip (members - nobody else gets a stand-in, TEASE-01), the 3 latest puzzles, the player's
    pages Overview · Results · Statistics, then Favorite · Compare · Message · ⋯ (Share). No Block (D12: it stays on the profile), no "Challenge" (reserved for
    duels). What the viewer may do comes from PlayerActionsResolver - the same decisions as the player header.

    Rendered inside <turbo-frame id="player-card">: in the layer of assets/player_card_layer.js (a bottom sheet below
    576 px - the shared bottom-sheet controller drags its .player-card-box - a popover from there) and on the card's own
    page. Links leaving the card carry data-turbo-frame="_top"; Favorite and Compare stay in the frame and come back to
    it with the card's `context`. A guest's sign-in links carry data-card-return-page: the layer points their `return`
    at the page the card was opened on (the response stays the same for every guest). Every link and button carries
    data-nav="card/<context kind | none>/<item>" (P0-03).

    The context block (CARD-02, players/_card_context.html.twig) sits under the chips. On the player's own card (CARD-04)
    the actions are the owner's: "Edit this result" (a feed / notification result they may edit), "Your results on this
    puzzle" (the result detail, opened over the card), Edit profile, View profile - never Favorite, Compare or Message.

    Inputs (PlayerCardController): player (PlayerProfile), card (PlayerCard), actions (PlayerActions), context
    (null|PlayerCardContext), context_block (null|PlayerCard*Context - GetPlayerCardContext), viewer_is_member (bool),
    activity (list of {month, solved} - members only)
#}
{%- set name = player.playerName ?? ('#' ~ player.code|upper) -%}
{%- set profile_path = path('player_profile', {playerId: player.playerId}) -%}
{%- set card_path = path('player_card', context ? {playerId: player.playerId, context: context.toString} : {playerId: player.playerId}) -%}
{%- set nav = 'card/' ~ (context ? context.kind.value : 'none') ~ '/' -%}
{%- set no_value -%}<span aria-hidden="true">–</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'players.card.none'|trans }}</span>{%- endset -%}
<article class="players-card" aria-labelledby="players-card-name" {{ stimulus_controller('bottom-sheet', {panel: '.player-card-box'}) }}>
    {# The sheet's handle and the player: a drag here pulls the sheet down on phones (GEST-02) #}
    <div class="players-card-top bottom-sheet-top" {{ stimulus_target('bottom-sheet', 'handle') }}>
        <span class="bottom-sheet-handle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="players-card-id">
            {{ include('_player_avatar.html.twig', {
                player_id: player.playerId,
                name: name,
                avatar: player.avatar,
                country_code: player.countryCode ? player.countryCode.name : null,
                country_name: player.countryCode ? player.countryCode.value : null,
                size: 'lg',
            }) }}
            <div class="players-card-who">
                <h2 class="players-card-name" id="players-card-name">
                    <a href="{{ profile_path }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}profile">{{ name }}</a>
                </h2>
                <div class="players-card-meta">
                    <span class="players-card-code">#{{ player.code|upper }}</span>
                    {%- if player.countryCode %} · {{ player.countryCode.value }}{% endif -%}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {# Only inside the layer (assets/player_card_layer.js closes it); after the name, so the name is focused first #}
        <button type="button" class="btn-close players-card-close" data-player-card-close data-nav="{{ nav }}close" aria-label="{{ 'players.card.close'|trans }}"></button>
    </div>

    <div class="players-card-body" {{ stimulus_target('bottom-sheet', 'body') }}>
        {# Progression: the XP level and the skill tier only (docs/features/xp-levels/launch-2026-10.md). The level is
           public unless the player opted out of the experience system; the tier chip is PlayerActions::$tierChip #}
        {% if actions.showLevel or actions.tierChip is not null %}
            <ul class="players-card-chips players-card-progress">
                {% if actions.showLevel %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip players-card-chip-level{{ player.maxLevel ? ' is-max' }}" title="{{ 'xp.total_tooltip'|trans({'%xp%': player.xpTotal}) }}">
                        {{ 'xp.level_chip'|trans({'%level%': player.level}) }}
                    </li>
                {% endif %}
                {% if actions.tierChip == 'tier' %}
                    {% set tier = player.skillTier.name|lower %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip players-card-chip-tier" style="--chip-color: var(--rank-{{ tier }})">
                        <svg class="rank-icon" width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/rank-icons-sprite.svg#rank-{{ tier }}"/></svg>
                        {{ ('puzzle_intelligence.skill.tiers.' ~ tier)|trans }}
                    </li>
                {% elseif actions.tierChip == 'no_tier_yet' %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip">{{ 'player_header.no_tier_yet'|trans }}</li>
                {% elseif actions.tierChip == 'locked' %}
                    {# The card's one members teaser (README §6, TEASE-01): passive, it opens the members modal only when
                       clicked, and its placement rides along (MembersPlacement) #}
                    <li>
                        <button type="button" class="players-card-chip players-card-chip-locked" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#membersExclusiveModal" data-members-placement="card.tier" title="{{ 'player_header.tier_locked_title'|trans }}" data-nav="{{ nav }}tier_locked">
                            <i class="ci-locked" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                            {{ 'players.card.tier_locked'|trans }}
                        </button>
                    </li>
                {% endif %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {% set context_block = context_block|default(null) %}
        {% if context is not null and context_block is not null and (context.kind.value != 'puzzle' or context_block.hasLine) %}
            {{ include('players/_card_context.html.twig', {context: context, block: context_block, actions: actions}) }}
        {% endif %}

        <dl class="players-card-stats">
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.solved'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ card.solvedTotal|plain_number }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.pieces'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd title="{{ card.piecesTotal|plain_number }}">
                    {%- if card.piecesTotal >= 999500 -%}
                        {{ 'players.card.millions'|trans({'%count%': (card.piecesTotal / 1000000)|round(1)|plain_number}) }}
                    {%- elseif card.piecesTotal >= 10000 -%}
                        {{ 'players.card.thousands'|trans({'%count%': (card.piecesTotal / 1000)|round|plain_number}) }}
                    {%- else -%}
                        {{ card.piecesTotal|plain_number }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.favorites'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ card.favoritesCount|plain_number }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.best500'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ card.best500Seconds is null ? no_value : card.best500Seconds|puzzlingTime }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.best1000'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ card.best1000Seconds is null ? no_value : card.best1000Seconds|puzzlingTime }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="players-card-stat">
                <dt>{{ 'players.card.last_solve'|trans }}</dt>
                <dd>{{ card.lastSolvedAt is null ? no_value : card.lastSolvedAt|ago }}</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>

        {# The 12-month strip: members only, and nothing in its place for anybody else (TEASE-01 - the tier chip above is
           the card's one teaser) #}
        {% if viewer_is_member %}
            {% set busiest = card.busiestMonth %}
            {% set described = [] %}
            {% for bar in activity %}
                {% set described = described|merge([bar.month|format_date(pattern: 'LLL yyyy') ~ ': ' ~ bar.solved]) %}
            {% endfor %}
            <div class="players-card-activity">
                <div class="players-card-bars" role="img" aria-label="{{ 'players.card.activity_label'|trans }}: {{ described|join(', ') }}">
                    {%- for bar in activity -%}
                        <i style="height: {{ (bar.solved / busiest * 100)|round }}%" title="{{ 'players.card.activity_bar'|trans({'%month%': bar.month|format_date(pattern: 'LLLL yyyy'), '%count%': bar.solved}) }}"></i>
                    {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
                {% if activity is not empty %}
                    <div class="players-card-activity-labels" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span>{{ 'players.card.activity_label'|trans }} · {{ (activity|first).month|format_date(pattern: 'LLL') }}</span>
                        <span>{{ (activity|last).month|format_date(pattern: 'LLL') }}</span>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {# What the player does besides puzzling against the clock - their own line #}
        {% if card.competesInEvents or card.swapsPuzzles or card.onInstagram %}
            <ul class="players-card-chips">
                {% if card.competesInEvents %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip"><i class="bi bi-calendar-event" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.competes'|trans }}</li>
                {% endif %}
                {% if card.swapsPuzzles %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.swaps'|trans }}</li>
                {% endif %}
                {% if card.onInstagram %}
                    <li class="players-card-chip"><i class="bi bi-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.instagram'|trans }}</li>
                {% endif %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {# The latest puzzles (GetPlayerCard: no secret puzzle, no result awaiting verification, a secret picture masked) #}
        {% if card.recentPuzzles is not empty %}
            <section class="players-card-recent" aria-labelledby="players-card-recent-title">
                <h3 class="players-card-section-title" id="players-card-recent-title">{{ 'players.card.recent_title'|trans }}</h3>
                <ul class="players-card-boxes">
                    {% for puzzle in card.recentPuzzles %}
                        {% set puzzle_label = puzzle.manufacturerName ~ ' ' ~ puzzle.puzzleName %}
                        <li>
                            <a class="players-card-puzzle" href="{{ path('puzzle_detail', {puzzleId: puzzle.puzzleId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}puzzle" title="{{ puzzle_label }}">
                                {{ lazy_puzzle_image(puzzle.image, 'puzzle_small', 'puzzle_img_alt'|trans({'%puzzle%': puzzle_label}), loop.index, 72, 'rounded-2', 72, puzzle.imageRatio) }}
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </section>
        {% endif %}

        {# The player's pages - the labels of the player header's tabs (PROF-02) #}
        <nav class="players-card-pages" aria-label="{{ 'player_header.pages'|trans }}">
            <a class="players-card-page-link" data-press href="{{ profile_path }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}overview">{{ 'player_header.tabs.overview'|trans }}</a>
            <a class="players-card-page-link" data-press href="{{ path('player_results', {playerId: player.playerId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}results">{{ 'player_header.tabs.results'|trans }}</a>
            <a class="players-card-page-link" data-press href="{{ path('player_statistics', {playerId: player.playerId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" rel="nofollow" data-nav="{{ nav }}statistics">{{ 'player_header.tabs.statistics'|trans }}</a>
        </nav>

        {# What Favorite / Compare just did. Read only by a visitor with a session - reading starts one otherwise #}
        {% if app.request.hasPreviousSession %}
            {% set comparison_added_flash = constant('SpeedPuzzling\\Web\\Controller\\AddComparisonSubjectController::ADDED_FLASH') %}
            {% for label in ['success', 'info', 'warning', 'danger'] %}
                {% for message in app.flashes(label) %}
                    <p class="players-card-notice players-card-notice-{{ label }}" role="status">{{ message }}</p>
                {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% for added in app.flashes(comparison_added_flash) %}
                <p class="players-card-notice players-card-notice-success" role="status">
                    {{ added.message }}
                    <a href="{{ path('comparison', added.kind ? {kind: added.kind} : {}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}compare_open">{{ 'comparison_entry.open'|trans }}</a>
                </p>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}

        <div class="players-card-actions{{ actions.isOwn ? ' is-own' }}">
            {% if actions.favorite == 'on' %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm players-card-action players-card-favorite is-on" href="{{ path('remove_player_from_favorite', {playerId: player.playerId, return: card_path}) }}" rel="nofollow" data-turbo-prefetch="false" data-nav="{{ nav }}favorite" title="{{ 'profile.remove_from_favorites'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'profile.remove_from_favorites'|trans }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-star-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.favorite_on'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% elseif actions.favorite == 'off' %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-favorite" href="{{ path('add_player_to_favorite', {playerId: player.playerId, return: card_path}) }}" rel="nofollow" data-turbo-prefetch="false" data-nav="{{ nav }}favorite" title="{{ 'profile.add_to_favorites'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'profile.add_to_favorites'|trans }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-star" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.favorite'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% elseif actions.favorite == 'sign_in' %}
                {# Signing in comes back with the player in favorites (the route asks for sign-in first) - to the profile
                   on the card's own page, to the page the card was opened on in the layer (data-card-return-page) #}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-favorite" href="{{ path('add_player_to_favorite', {playerId: player.playerId, return: profile_path}) }}" rel="nofollow" data-turbo-prefetch="false" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-card-return-page data-nav="{{ nav }}favorite" title="{{ 'profile.add_to_favorites'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'profile.add_to_favorites'|trans }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-star" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.favorite'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if actions.compare == 'add' %}
                {{ include('comparison_entry/_subject_form.html.twig', {
                    action: 'add',
                    subject: actions.comparisonRef,
                    form_class: 'players-card-action-form',
                    button_class: 'btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action',
                    icon: 'bi-arrow-left-right',
                    label: 'players.card.compare'|trans,
                    nav: nav ~ 'compare',
                }) }}
            {% elseif actions.compare == 'open' %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action is-on" href="{{ path('comparison', {kind: 'solo'}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}compare" title="{{ 'player_header.compare_open'|trans }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.compare_open'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% elseif actions.compare == 'sign_in' %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action" href="{{ path('login', {return: profile_path}) }}" rel="nofollow" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-card-return-page data-nav="{{ nav }}compare">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.compare'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if actions.canMessage %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-message" href="{{ path('start_conversation', {recipientId: player.playerId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="modal-frame" rel="nofollow" data-nav="{{ nav }}message">
                    <i class="bi bi-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'player_header.message'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% endif %}

            {# The owner's own card (CARD-04): what they can do about the result or puzzle the card was opened on, their
               profile - the ⋯ keeps Share #}
            {% if actions.isOwn %}
                {% set kind = context ? context.kind.value : null %}
                {% if (kind == 'feed' or kind == 'notification') and context_block is not null and context_block.isEditableBy(player.playerId) %}
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-own players-card-own-context" href="{{ path('edit_time', {timeId: context_block.timeId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" rel="nofollow" data-nav="{{ nav }}edit_result">
                        <i class="bi bi-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.edit_result'|trans }}
                    </a>
                {% elseif kind == 'puzzle' and context_block is not null and context_block.ownTimeId is not null %}
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-own players-card-own-context" href="{{ path('puzzle_result_detail', {timeId: context_block.ownTimeId}) }}" data-turbo-frame="modal-frame" rel="nofollow" data-nav="{{ nav }}own_results">
                        <i class="bi bi-list-ol" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.own_results_on_puzzle'|trans }}
                    </a>
                {% endif %}
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-own" href="{{ path('edit_profile') }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}edit_profile">
                    <i class="bi bi-pencil-square" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'menu.edit_profile'|trans }}
                </a>
                <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-own" href="{{ profile_path }}" data-turbo-frame="_top" data-nav="{{ nav }}view_profile">
                    <i class="bi bi-person" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ 'players.card.view_profile'|trans }}
                </a>
            {% endif %}

            {# ⋯: Share (the "Challenge" of README §4.8 is reserved for duels - not rendered) #}
            <details class="players-card-more">
                <summary class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary players-card-action players-card-more-toggle" title="{{ 'player_header.more_actions'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'player_header.more_actions'|trans }}">
                    <i class="bi bi-three-dots" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </summary>
                <div class="players-card-more-items">
                    {{ include('player/_share_profile_button.html.twig', {class: 'players-card-more-item', label: 'player_header.share_profile'|trans, nav: nav ~ 'share'}) }}
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </div>
</article>
